    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Marleen Temmerman, Chair, Department of Obstetrics & Gynaecology and Director, Women's Health and Research, Faculty of Health Sciences at the Aga Khan University in East Africa has received the prestigious Marie Popelin award 2016 in recognition of her endeavours for women's rights.",
